    "1 Strained → 5 Thriving": {},
    "6-digit code": {},
    "7 days": {},
    "7-day connection challenge": {},
    "14 days": {},
    "30 days": {},
    "A coach, not a therapist": {},
    "A day at a time. Past entries will appear here as you go.": {},
    "A deeper connection.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक गहरा जुड़ाव।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una conexión más profunda."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A look back": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक नज़र पीछे"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Una mirada atrás"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A private space for couples to reflect, understand and grow together — in your own way.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "जोड़ों के लिए एक निजी जगह, जहाँ वे सोच सकें, समझ सकें और साथ बढ़ सकें — अपने अपने तरीके से।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un espacio privado para parejas, donde reflexionar, comprender y crecer juntos — a su manera."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A quiet daily ritual you share with one person. You can begin on your own — everything is here waiting when they join.": {
      "localizations": {
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "एक शांत दैनिक अनुष्ठान जिसे आप एक व्यक्ति के साथ साझा करते हैं। आप अकेले शुरू कर सकते हैं — जब वे जुड़ेंगे, सब कुछ यहीं इंतज़ार कर रहा होगा।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Un ritual diario tranquilo que compartes con una persona. Puedes empezar por tu cuenta — cuando se una, todo estará aquí esperando."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A read on the last two weeks, not a verdict. It looks at three things: how you have been feeling, how often you showed up, and how steady it has been.": {},
    "A readable copy of your journal, coach conversations, and memories. It leaves the encrypted store, so keep it somewhere safe.": {},
    "A safety check runs on everything you type. If it detects a crisis, the app stops generating a normal reply and shows you support lines instead. Your partner is never told.": {},
    "A year of showing up": {},
